sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Learner
    participant UI as React UI (staged progress)
    participant API as Backend
    participant C as Compact model
    participant G as Large model
    L->>UI: "I don't understand this exercise…"
    UI->>API: POST /messages (mode=guided)
    Note over UI: stage 1/4 "Understanding your question"
    API->>C: triage → {language, intent, confusion, complexity}
    Note over UI: stage 2/4 "Searching your documents" (BM25, no model)
    API->>API: hint policy (level 0→1→2), style & level from profile
    Note over UI: stage 3/4 "Thinking…" (large only if needed)
    alt complexity low & ≤2 passages
        API->>C: tutor_answer (hint first, adapted to learning style, in learner's language)
    else complexity high / full solution / synthesis
        API->>G: tutor_answer
    end
    Note over UI: stage 4/4 "Formatting"
    API-->>UI: answer_md + guiding question + next step + sources + ai metadata
    UI-->>L: hint · "Reveal full answer" button · tier badge · fallback notice if any
